    "methods_description": "64-channel EEG was recorded in DC mode (reference: right mastoid) with electrode locations digitized for source analysis. TMS targeted the FDI hand muscle representation of M1 in each hemisphere using MRI navigation. Single-pulse TMS ran at 100% or 110% resting motor threshold. Resting-state EEG (eyes open, fixation cross) was recorded without TMS. MRI sessions included T1w, resting-state fMRI, and multiband (SMS) HARDI diffusion imaging with 271 directions.",
